# WhatsApp CRM Integration Plan

Official Meta WhatsApp Cloud API → HydrogenRO CRM. Implement **one phase at a time**. Test **locally** (`npm run dev` + `.env.local`); do **not** Netlify-deploy unless the user asks.

## Principles (every phase)

- Secrets in **`app_secrets`** (fallback: env for local). Never expose tokens to the client.
- New tables: **RLS + `public.is_admin_user()`**; webhook/send writes via **service role only**.
- Store **metadata + text** (and media URLs), not full Meta JSON forever.
- Media: short-lived object storage (Cloudinary/R2), not DB blobs.
- **7-day retention** via `purge_ephemeral_data` / `ephemeral-data-cleanup` cron.
- **No 3s polling** in production CRM — Realtime or fetch-on-open.
- Chat UI **mobile-first**, WhatsApp-like.
- Cold outbound (no open 24h window) needs **approved templates** (Phase 6). Free-form OK inside 24h after customer messages.

## Current status

- POC send works locally (text + PDF) with production number.
- `hello_world` is **test-number only** (Meta #131058) — do not use on the real number.
- CRM customer WhatsApp sends (composer, Calling, pending payments) use Cloud API with wa.me fallback when the 24h window is closed.
- Technician job-share WhatsApp stays on `wa.me` (personal tech numbers, not the business API line).
- Profile photos (DP) not available from Meta Cloud API — deferred.

## Phases

| Phase | Scope | Status |
|-------|--------|--------|
| **1. Foundation** | `whatsapp_messages` + RLS, 7-day purge, `whatsapp-helper` + `app_secrets`, harden `whatsapp-send` (admin auth + persist outbound) | Done (local) |
| **2. Inbound webhook** | Persist inbound + statuses; media → storage URL; local verify via ngrok (no site deploy) | Done (local) |
| **3. Chat UI** | Admin Tools → WhatsApp inbox (thread list + chat), mobile responsive, reply in 24h window | Done (local) |
| **4. Wire CRM sends** | Composer / customer flows: API send (keep wa.me as fallback if useful) | Done (local) |
| **5. AMC / bill / PDF** | Existing PDF generators → temp public HTTPS → document send; log in thread | Done (local) — quotation / invoice / bill / warranty share Email\|WhatsApp send UI (wa.me backup) |
| **6. Templates** | Meta approved templates for cold outreach; inbox picker when 24h closed | Done (local) — **create/approve templates in Meta Manager**; Calling / service reminders / tech-assigned use API → template → wa.me |

**Out of v1:** forever backup, multi-agent assignment, full bot menus.

