## WhatsApp settings (CRM)

Panel: Settings → WhatsApp → **Settings** (`?panel=whatsapp-settings`).  
Table `whatsapp_crm_settings` (singleton): master enable, cold/PDF/freeform toggles, editable INR rates, monthly budget.  
Usage RPC `whatsapp_usage_stats` → expected bill from last 7 days + monthly projection.  
`whatsapp-send` enforces toggles server-side.

## Data (Phase 1+)

Table `whatsapp_messages`: `wa_message_id`, `direction` (in/out), `phone_e164`, `customer_id?`, `type`, `body`, `media_url?`, `media_mime?`, `filename?`, `status`, `template_name?`, `sent_by_user_id?`, `created_at`.  
Index `(phone_e164, created_at DESC)`. Purge rows older than **7 days**.

## Hook points

- Send: `netlify/functions/whatsapp-send.js` + `whatsapp-helper.js`
- Webhook: `netlify/functions/whatsapp-webhook.js` (Phase 2)
- UI: Admin Tools → WhatsApp inbox / Settings panel `whatsapp-inbox` (Phase 3 done)
- PDF: `whatsapp-send` accepts `pdfBase64` → Cloudinary (`whatsapp/outbound`) → Meta document. Composer auto-attaches bill/invoice; AMC has **WhatsApp AMC PDF** button.
- Templates: `whatsapp-templates.js` lists APPROVED; inbox cold-send when 24h closed.

## Auth

- Production CRM send: **admin JWT** (`authorizeAdminRequest` / Bearer).
- Local POC only: optional `WHATSAPP_POC_SECRET` (`pocSecret` body field).
- Webhook verify: `VERIFY_TOKEN` / `app_secrets.whatsapp_verify_token`.
